<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>ORG Linux packages</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 42rem; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    code, pre { background: #f4f4f5; padding: 0.15em 0.4em; border-radius: 4px; }
    pre { padding: 1rem; overflow-x: auto; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>ORG packages</h1>
  <p>Shared apt + dnf repositories for ORG CLI tools. Pool: <a href="deb/">deb/</a> · <a href="rpm/">rpm/</a>.</p>

  <h2>PROJECT_NAME (PRODUCT)</h2>
  <p><a href="https://github.com/ORG/GITHUB_REPO">ORG/GITHUB_REPO</a></p>
  <pre>curl -fsSL @REPO_URL@/install-apt-PRODUCT.sh | sudo bash
curl -fsSL @REPO_URL@/install-dnf-PRODUCT.sh | sudo bash</pre>

  <p>Add more &lt;h2&gt; sections here as you onboard additional products to the shared pool.</p>
  <p>Lists: <a href="PRODUCT.list">PRODUCT.list</a> · repos: <a href="PRODUCT.repo">PRODUCT.repo</a></p>
</body>
</html>
